      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "description": "One source's membership in a pool. `ordinal` is the default selection order\n(ascending); a disabled member is skipped. `selection_weight` is reserved for a\nfuture weighted policy and does not affect the default ordinal order.",
      "properties": {
